WHAT YOU MAY DO

  * Install and use this module in your own Foundry Virtual Tabletop worlds,
    for private or commercial play. Running paid games with it is fine.
  * Keep copies for backup.
  * Modify it for use at your own table.
  * Write your own, separate module that works together with this one, for
    example through its hooks or its API, as long as it contains none of this
    module's code or assets.

